    "idea": "ASTONISHING Four-Colour Mezzanine overlooking the Narthex abyss: cycle 3 stained-glass filters (gold/blue/rose) to bridge the 8-tile chasm, offset the X-mirrored Mimic Statue into the baffle beam to shade Shadow Gate sgate_r9, hang the lantern to slip unlit onto the North Overlook, and claim the Boss Key + Pane toll_wick!",
